      "id": "claim_e1a7b7a62ed743e6802f21c80e064c9b",
      "statement": "TeamGateway (registered on the host via apply()) exposes the team feature as a TypertRemoteService with eight @Remote methods — listTeams, createTeam, updateTeam, deleteTeam, listThreads, openThread, getThread, send — and injects ['llm', 'agentDefaultModel'] to answer as the local 'me' agent; it reuses the shared A2A registry (loadA2AConfig, resolveAgent, a2aSendMessage, a2aBaseUrl) instead of owning a separate external-agent list.",
